# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Laundry Legends — repository ignore rules
# Keep source, documentation, Unity project settings, and asset metadata.
# Ignore generated caches, builds, local tool state, and credentials.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Unity generated / local-only directories
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/*
![Bb]uilds/.gitkeep
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage

# Unity / IDE generated files
*.csproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.unityproj
*.booproj
*.svd
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
ExportedObj/
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties

# Unity crash / log artifacts
*.stacktrace
*.log
Logs/
Builds/*.log

# Test and profiling output (keep directory marker)
TestResults/*
!TestResults/.gitkeep
Profiler/
MemoryCaptures/

# Local orchestration state and approval cache
.orchestrator/worktrees/
.orchestrator/*.local
.orchestrator/**/*.local
.orchestrator/reports/*.private.md
.orchestrator/approvals.local.json
.orchestrator/tmp/

# Secrets and local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.secret
*.secrets
credentials.json
auth.json
*.pem
*.key

# Tool / package caches that must not be committed
.npm/
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.cache/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# Local recordings and captures (large binaries)
Captures/
Screenshots/
Recordings/

# Local TTS tooling (W6). The Piper binary and the voice models are ~376 MB of
# third-party downloads kept for reproducibility only; they are not part of the
# game build and must not be committed. Re-download with the steps in
# ArtSource/Licenses/piper-tts.md.
Tools/Piper/piper/
Tools/Piper/voices/
# Portable MakeHuman install (downloaded app, not source)
Tools/MakeHuman/
ArtSource/Downloads/

# Staged working copies and superseded model exports (not shipped)
ArtSource/Drafts/
ArtSource/Exports/NPC/
ArtSource/Blender/rescale_npc_models.py
ArtSource/Blender/WrappedBundle.blend1

# Blender auto-backups
*.blend1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal Engine 5 sample (local-only experiment, never opened on this machine)
# Not part of the Unity project; nothing under Assets/ or Packages/ uses it.
# Delete UnrealSample/ to remove the sample. See UnrealSample/README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
UnrealSample/
